WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:04.226
Unit nineteen. Cultural Exchange Programs!

2
00:00:05.224 --> 00:00:13.270
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Intermediate level!

3
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:17.885
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:21.767
Today we learn: Cultural Exchange Programs. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.465 --> 00:00:27.399
Cultural exchange. Say it with me. Cultural exchange!

6
00:00:30.899 --> 00:00:35.233
Host family. Say it with me. Host family!

7
00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.463
Immersion. Say it with me. Immersion!

8
00:00:45.984 --> 00:00:50.768
Broaden perspective. Say it with me. Broaden perspective!

9
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.950
Adapt. Say it with me. Adapt!

10
00:01:01.383 --> 00:01:05.949
Foreign language. Say it with me. Foreign language!

11
00:01:09.453 --> 00:01:14.669
Global mindset. Say it with me. Global mindset!

12
00:01:18.186 --> 00:01:22.553
Experience. Say it with me. Experience!

13
00:01:26.047 --> 00:01:37.138
Grammar time! Purpose clauses (so that). Listen. Students live with a host family so that they can fully immerse in the culture.

14
00:01:37.188 --> 00:01:44.561
Your turn. Say it with me. Students live with a host family so that they can fully immerse in the culture.

15
00:01:49.527 --> 00:02:04.953
A cultural exchange program lets students live with a host family for full immersion in a new culture. This experience helps broaden perspective, improve a foreign language, and build a global mindset as students learn to adapt.

16
00:02:05.003 --> 00:02:06.536
I like this story!

17
00:02:07.578 --> 00:02:12.861
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:12.911 --> 00:02:14.061
Immersion!

19
00:02:15.078 --> 00:02:20.426
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:20.476 --> 00:02:22.029
Global mindset!

21
00:02:23.245 --> 00:02:32.912
Think and answer. What would you hope to gain from a cultural exchange experience?

22
00:02:32.962 --> 00:02:34.116
Great answer!

23
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.459
This unit's value is Cultural Openness.

24
00:02:38.509 --> 00:02:41.333
I can show cultural openness every day!

25
00:02:42.042 --> 00:02:50.445
Congratulations, everyone! You finished the Intermediate level. See you in Upper-Intermediate. Goodbye!

26
00:02:50.495 --> 00:02:54.958
Thank you, Teacher Chanthy! See you in Upper-Intermediate!

